      <li><button class="quiz-option" data-correct="true" type="button"><span class="quiz-opt-letter">B</span>Starts processing Request C immediately</button></li>
      <li><button class="quiz-option" type="button"><span class="quiz-opt-letter">C</span>Spawns a new thread for Request C</button></li>
