    </ul>
    <button class="quiz-reveal-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Show Answer <span class="quiz-chevron">▾</span></button>
    <div class="quiz-answer">
      <div class="quiz-answer-inner">
        <div class="quiz-answer-highlight">✓ Correct: <strong>(B) Starts processing Request C immediately</strong></div>
        <p class="quiz-answer-text">When A and B hit <code>await</code>, they yield control back to the loop. The loop doesn't sit idle — it picks up the next ready task. This is the core power of async: zero idle time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Q3 -->
  <div class="quiz-card">
    <div class="quiz-card-header">
      <span class="quiz-q-num">Q 03</span>
      <span class="quiz-type-tag">True or False</span>
    </div>
    <p class="quiz-question">The event loop runs multiple coroutines at the exact same instant in time.</p>
    <ul class="quiz-options">
      <li><button class="quiz-option" type="button"><span class="quiz-opt-letter">A</span>True</button></li>
      <li><button class="quiz-option" data-correct="true" type="button"><span class="quiz-opt-letter">B</span>False</button></li>
    </ul>
    <button class="quiz-reveal-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Show Answer <span class="quiz-chevron">▾</span></button>
